#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This tire data selects the model option "External Shear Model."  All tire forces and moments at CTC (central tire contact) and WC (wheel center) are supposed to be imported from the external tire model namely on Simulink.
#
#However, the data for vertical force on this screen (effective rolling radius, free radius, and spring rate) are used to initialize the vehicle height position and wheel speeds.
#
#References 195/45 R16 Animator Shape Data, but the shape is resized for 225/60 R18 in the animation.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

